<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Getting Started</h1>
<p>Get up and running with UTMPro in under 5 minutes.</p>

<h2>Step 1: Create an Account</h2>
<p>Visit <a href="/register">utmpro.link/register</a> and sign up with your email or Google account.</p>

<h2>Step 2: Create a Workspace</h2>
<p>After registration, you'll be prompted to create a workspace. A workspace is where your team manages links, domains, and analytics.</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Workspace Name</strong> — Your team or company name</li>
    <li><strong>Workspace URL</strong> — Auto-generated from the name (e.g., <code>app.utmpro.link/my-company</code>)</li>
</ul>

<h2>Step 3: Create Your First Link</h2>
<ol>
    <li>Click <strong>+ Create Link</strong> in the top-right corner</li>
    <li>Paste your destination URL (the long URL you want to shorten)</li>
    <li>Choose a domain (default: <code>go.utmpro.link</code>)</li>
    <li>Optionally set a custom slug, UTM parameters, or password</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Create Link</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Your short link is created and automatically copied to your clipboard! 🎉</p>

<h2>Step 4: Track Clicks</h2>
<p>Share your short link anywhere. Every click is tracked in real-time with:</p>
<ul>
    <li>📍 Geographic location (country, city)</li>
    <li>📱 Device type (desktop, mobile, tablet)</li>
    <li>🌐 Browser and OS</li>
    <li>🔗 Referrer source</li>
    <li>📊 UTM parameters</li>
</ul>

<h2>Step 5: Explore More Features</h2>
